---
import V5Layout from '../layouts/V5Layout.astro';
const title = "AiRE - Subsurface intelligence that evolves with the science";
const description = "AiRE re-reads the exploration data you already own against current, peer-reviewed deposit science - and returns ranked, evidence-traced targets. Your data. Today's tech. Tomorrow's targets.";
const bodyHtml = "\n\n<main>\n\n<!-- ============ 1 \u00b7 HERO - Living Methodology ============ -->\n<section class=\"hero\">\n  <div class=\"wrap hero-grid\">\n    <div>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">From a fire-hose of evidence to one defensible decision</p>\n      <h1>The best-evidenced bet you&rsquo;ll take to the board.</h1>\n      <span class=\"cadence\">Your data. Today&rsquo;s tech. Tomorrow&rsquo;s targets.</span>\n      <p class=\"lead\">AiRE resolves the exploration data you already own - satellite imagery, geophysics, geochemistry, drilling - into a ranked, evidence-traced target list: every weight cited, every gap disclosed. You stay in command of every call - the model shows its work; your geologist signs.</p>\n      <div class=\"hero-ctas\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-gold\" href=\"/engage\">Get the 48-Hour Prospect Brief <span class=\"arr\">\u2192</span></a>\n        <a class=\"hero-secondary\" href=\"/v5/viewer.html\">or fly an interactive 3D model first \u2192</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <figure class=\"hero-vis reveal\">\n      <!-- Illustrative 3D prospectivity terrain model: DISTORTED DEM (no location data), synthetic targets + structures. Drape texture = royalty-free Pexels imagery (free for commercial use) - swapped in 2026-06 to clear the Google Earth/Airbus licensing gate before public launch. -->\n      <img src=\"/v5/images/regional_priority_map.webp\" alt=\"Illustrative 3D prospectivity terrain model - synthetic ranked targets and geological structures draped over terrain (illustrative)\">\n      <div class=\"hero-legend\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Legend: pink is priority 1, red is priority 2, orange is priority 3\">\n        <span><i style=\"background:#b14ac4\"></i>Priority 1</span>\n        <span><i style=\"background:#d73621\"></i>Priority 2</span>\n        <span><i style=\"background:#e88a1c\"></i>Priority 3</span>\n      </div>\n      <figcaption class=\"illustrative-cap\">Illustrative model only &mdash; synthetic targets on a distorted terrain, not real project data. The drill-proven program is below.</figcaption>\n    </figure>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- proof strip: drill-proven nickel - lead with the real, verifiable proof (above credentials) -->\n<div class=\"proof-strip\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <p><strong>Drill-proven.</strong> On a live East African nickel program, CAGE-IN-ranked targets were drill-tested and returned confirmed nickel mineralization - carried from raw archives to the rig. <a class=\"textlink\" href=\"/case-studies\">See the flagship case &rarr;</a></p>\n      <div class=\"proof-nums\"><span><b>308</b> ranked target polygons</span><span><b>13</b> evidence layers</span><span><b>167</b> geochem analytes</span><span><b>100%</b> of coverage gaps disclosed</span></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- stat strip -->\n<div class=\"stat-strip\">\n  <div class=\"wrap stat-strip-inner\">\n    <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"num\">30<span>+</span></div><div class=\"lbl\">years finding minerals in the field</div></div>\n    <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"num\">5</div><div class=\"lbl\">continents of exploration experience</div></div>\n    <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"num\">12</div><div class=\"lbl\">deposit models, calibrated to peer-reviewed literature</div></div>\n    <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"num\">220<span>+</span></div><div class=\"lbl\">automated tests - every release reproduces the same answer on the same data</div></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ============ 1.5 \u00b7 TRUST BAND + DECISION FILTER ============ -->\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"trust\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Why you can trust a score from us</p><h2>Not a black box. A score you can audit.</h2></div>\n<div class=\"trust-grid\">\n<div class=\"trust-pillar\"><h4>Every weight is cited</h4><p>Each parameter in every deposit model traces to peer-reviewed literature - no folklore, no unexplained weighting.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trust-pillar\"><h4>Every gap is named</h4><p>The coverage disclosure shows exactly what your data could not see - the dark layers are on the page, not hidden.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trust-pillar\"><h4>A named geologist signs</h4><p>A <a class=\"textlink\" href=\"/council\">seasoned explorer</a> takes charge and signs off on every report. The model shows its work; you make the call on every target.</p></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"trust-contrast\">Most AI-prospectivity tools bolt an explanation onto a black box. Here the explanation <em>is</em> the model - every score is traceable to a cited weight and a disclosed gap by construction.</p>\n<div class=\"decision-filter\">\n<div class=\"df-item\"><span class=\"df-q\">Where do I drill?</span><a class=\"df-a\" href=\"/case-studies\">ranked targets &rarr;</a></div>\n<div class=\"df-item\"><span class=\"df-q\">How sure are we?</span><a class=\"df-a\" href=\"/case-studies\">cited weights + ensemble agreement &rarr;</a></div>\n<div class=\"df-item\"><span class=\"df-q\">What can&rsquo;t the data see?</span><a class=\"df-a\" href=\"#evidence\">coverage disclosure &rarr;</a></div>\n<div class=\"df-item\"><span class=\"df-q\">Cost &amp; speed?</span><a class=\"df-a\" href=\"/engage\">48 hours, fixed scope &rarr;</a></div>\n</div></div></section>\n\n<!-- ============ 2 \u00b7 THE BUILDER'S STORY ============ -->\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"story\">\n  <div class=\"wrap story-grid\">\n    <div class=\"reveal\">\n      <div class=\"video-frame\" id=\"videoFrame\">\n        <!-- Live 90-second hook video (React/Babel timeline animation, audio-master sync).\n             Voice-over is the master clock; press play inside the frame to start with sound. -->\n        <!-- data-defer-src: mounted by js/main.js only after first paint AND when scrolled near\n             (two-phase loader) so the ~8.8 MB embed never competes with the hero on slow/mobile. -->\n        <iframe data-defer-src=\"/v5/media/hook-video/index.html\"\n                title=\"CAGE-IN - why AiRE exists (90-second hook video)\"\n                style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;border:0;background:#0a0a0a\"\n                allow=\"fullscreen\"></iframe>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"story-copy\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">The builder&rsquo;s story</p>\n      <h2>Thirty years in the field. One conclusion: the software wasn&rsquo;t keeping up.</h2>\n      <br>\n      <p>Dr. Amit Tripathi spent three decades finding minerals the hard way - mapping, drilling and modeling across twenty countries on five continents. On every project he watched the same quiet failure: the science of ore deposits kept advancing, paper by paper, while the software interpreting exploration data stayed frozen at whatever the vendor shipped. Decisions worth millions were being made with yesterday&rsquo;s understanding.</p>\n      <p>So he built what didn&rsquo;t exist: a live, GPU-accelerated targeting platform whose deposit models are calibrated to peer-reviewed literature and updated as the science moves - guarded by more than 220 automated regression tests, and proven on live exploration programs.</p>\n      <blockquote class=\"pullquote\">\n        <p class=\"q\">&ldquo;Every drill hole is a bet on an interpretation. I built CAGE-IN to make that bet the best-informed one on the table.&rdquo;</p>\n        <p class=\"who\">Dr. Amit Tripathi \u00b7 Founder, AiRE</p>\n      </blockquote>\n      <div class=\"cred-strip\">\n        <span class=\"cred\">PhD, Structural Geology</span>\n        <span class=\"cred\">30+ years in exploration</span>\n        <span class=\"cred\">22+ publications</span>\n        <span class=\"cred\">20+ countries</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============ 2.5 \u00b7 THE 80% REALITY - DATA INTAKE ============ -->\n<section class=\"section section-alt\" id=\"data-reality\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">The 80% reality</p>\n      <h2>We don&rsquo;t expect clean data. Clean exploration data doesn&rsquo;t exist.</h2>\n      <p class=\"lead\">Most of the work in modern targeting is not the algorithm - it is the wrangling. Legacy MapInfo files, drill logs scanned to PDF, coordinate systems from 1994: that is where exploration programs lose their months, and it is where we start.</p>\n    </div>\n    <blockquote class=\"pullquote worst-folder\">\n      <p class=\"q\">&ldquo;Bring us your absolute worst folder.&rdquo;</p>\n      <p class=\"pq-sub\">Mismatched datums, legacy geophysics, raw drill intercepts, unindexed geochemistry - the intake pipeline is built for the archive you actually have, not the database you wish you had.</p>\n    </blockquote>\n    <div class=\"intake-grid\">\n      <div class=\"intake-card reveal\">\n        <div class=\"intake-num\">01</div>\n        <h3>Custom geo-data automation</h3>\n        <p>Proprietary scripts ingest the structured majority - standardising datum projections, cleaning spatial coordinates and normalising assay detection limits across multi-year campaigns.</p>\n        <span class=\"intake-benefit\">Months of spreadsheet alignment, eliminated.</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"intake-card reveal\">\n        <div class=\"intake-num\">02</div>\n        <h3>Language-model parsing</h3>\n        <p>Specialised language-model pipelines read the &ldquo;dark data&rdquo; standard software ignores - scanned historical PDFs, unindexed drill logs, legacy structural reports - converting qualitative field notes into quantifiable spatial attributes.</p>\n        <span class=\"intake-benefit\">Value recovered from forgotten paper archives.</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"intake-card intake-feature reveal\">\n        <div class=\"intake-num\">03</div>\n        <h3>Geologist audit</h3>\n        <p>The safety catch. Every automated and language-model output is audited by an experienced exploration geologist before it reaches the targeting engine - checked at the rock level.</p>\n        <span class=\"intake-benefit\">Human scrutiny before anything is scored.</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============ 3 \u00b7 THE AiRE COUNCIL ============ -->\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"council\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">The AiRE Council</p>\n      <h2>You don&rsquo;t hire a consultant. You engage a council.</h2>\n      <p class=\"lead\">AiRE is led by a deep bench of senior exploration geologists and specialists spanning five continents. A named, qualified geologist - Dr.&nbsp;Tripathi - governs every project and signs every verdict. Working alongside that human team, a standing council of role-titled AI agents (economic geologists, engineers, quality enforcers, operators and a professional sceptic) does the tireless work - stress-testing every target and citing every weight before anything ships. The model shows its work; your geologist makes the call. Your data moves through an objective, repeatable, gate-checked pipeline - not one person&rsquo;s opinion.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"discipline-row\">\n      <div class=\"discipline reveal\">\n        <h4>No weight without citation</h4>\n        <p>Every parameter in every deposit model traces to published, peer-reviewed science. No exceptions, no folklore.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"discipline reveal\">\n        <h4>One seat exists to refute the rest</h4>\n        <p>Nothing ships until the council&rsquo;s adversarial auditor has stress-tested every conclusion for false positives - and failed to break it.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"discipline reveal\">\n        <h4>Project memory that compounds</h4>\n        <p>The council keeps an append-only record of your geology, your data and every decision - across sessions and across years.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p style=\"margin-top:2.4rem\"><a class=\"textlink\" href=\"/council\">Meet the human bench and the full council \u2192</a></p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============ 4 \u00b7 EVIDENCE & DELIVERABLES ============ -->\n<section class=\"section section-alt\" id=\"evidence\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">Outputs, not inputs</p>\n      <h2>Judge us by the deliverables.</h2>\n      <p class=\"lead\">Credentials are inputs. These are outputs - sanitized examples of what lands on your desk at the end of an AiRE engagement. Project names, locations and client identifiers removed; the substance intact.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"outputs-grid\">\n\n      <!-- 4 \u00b7 coverage disclosure (lifted to first per V4 review) -->\n      <article class=\"output-card reveal\">\n        <div class=\"output-thumb\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 270\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Evidence coverage disclosure chart showing active and dark evidence layers\">\n            <rect width=\"560\" height=\"270\" fill=\"#10202b\"/>\n            <g font-family=\"Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\">\n              <text x=\"40\" y=\"46\" fill=\"#9fb0b8\" font-weight=\"700\" letter-spacing=\"1.4\">EVIDENCE COVERAGE - DISCLOSED PER RUN</text>\n              <g>\n                <text x=\"40\" y=\"80\" fill=\"#c7d2d7\">alteration spectral suite</text><rect x=\"230\" y=\"70\" width=\"240\" height=\"12\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#9a5630\"/><text x=\"480\" y=\"80\" fill=\"#8aa0ad\">active</text>\n                <text x=\"40\" y=\"108\" fill=\"#c7d2d7\">magnetics + radiometrics</text><rect x=\"230\" y=\"98\" width=\"240\" height=\"12\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#9a5630\"/><text x=\"480\" y=\"108\" fill=\"#8aa0ad\">active</text>\n                <text x=\"40\" y=\"136\" fill=\"#c7d2d7\">geochemistry (multi-element)</text><rect x=\"230\" y=\"126\" width=\"186\" height=\"12\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#b58a1f\"/><text x=\"480\" y=\"136\" fill=\"#e3c465\">partial</text>\n                <text x=\"40\" y=\"164\" fill=\"#8a9aa3\">EM conductivity</text><rect x=\"230\" y=\"154\" width=\"240\" height=\"12\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#22333d\"/><text x=\"480\" y=\"164\" fill=\"#7e919b\">dark \u00b7 no input data</text>\n                <text x=\"40\" y=\"192\" fill=\"#8a9aa3\">structural / lithology map</text><rect x=\"230\" y=\"182\" width=\"240\" height=\"12\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#22333d\"/><text x=\"480\" y=\"192\" fill=\"#7e919b\">dark \u00b7 absent</text>\n              </g>\n              <text x=\"40\" y=\"238\" fill=\"#7e919b\">weight-mass scored: <tspan fill=\"#e3c465\" font-weight=\"700\">78%</tspan> - the remaining 22% is named, not hidden</text>\n            </g>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"output-body\">\n          <h3>Coverage &amp; confidence disclosure</h3>\n          <p>Every deliverable states plainly what your data could not see - which evidence layers were dark, why, and what it would take to light them up.</p>\n          <span class=\"output-tag\">Standard on every AiRE deliverable - no black-box scores</span>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <!-- 1 \u00b7 score raster -->\n      <article class=\"output-card reveal\">\n        <div class=\"output-thumb\">\n          <!-- Converted from 17 MB GIF to 6.9 MB looping MP4 (2026-06-13 payload pass).\n               data-defer-src + poster: video fetched/played by js/main.js after first paint, near viewport. -->\n          <video data-defer-src=\"/v5/images/regional_targets_rotation.mp4\" poster=\"/v5/images/regional_targets_rotation_poster.jpg\"\n                 muted loop playsinline preload=\"metadata\"\n                 aria-label=\"Rotating 3D terrain view of ranked exploration targets - high, mid and low priority polygons over an SRTM wireframe\"\n                 style=\"width:100%;display:block;aspect-ratio:4/3\"></video>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"output-body\">\n          <h3>Ranked prospectivity maps</h3>\n          <p>Multi-evidence score rasters with graded drill targets - every score traceable to the evidence layers, deposit model and literature behind it.</p>\n          <span class=\"output-tag\">Greenfield nickel program \u00b7 308 ranked target polygons from 13 evidence layers</span>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <!-- 2 \u00b7 3D viewer -->\n      <article class=\"output-card reveal\">\n        <div class=\"output-thumb\">\n          <!-- Converted from 17 MB GIF to 2.6 MB looping MP4 (2026-06-13 payload pass).\n               data-defer-src + poster: video fetched/played by js/main.js after first paint, near viewport. -->\n          <video data-defer-src=\"/v5/images/deposit3d_rotation_drilling.mp4\" poster=\"/v5/images/deposit3d_rotation_drilling_poster.jpg\"\n                 muted loop playsinline preload=\"metadata\"\n                 aria-label=\"Rotating 3D deposit model - orebody, drill traces and progressive drilling animation\"\n                 style=\"width:100%;display:block;aspect-ratio:4/3\"></video>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"output-body\">\n          <h3>Interactive 3D deposit models</h3>\n          <p>Single-file 3D viewers your whole board can open - fly through the orebody, inspect every drill intercept. No software, no login, works offline.</p>\n          <span class=\"output-tag\">3D large polymetallic deposit model</span>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <!-- 3 \u00b7 cross-section / alteration envelope -->\n      <article class=\"output-card reveal\">\n        <div class=\"output-thumb\">\n          <!-- Live interactive section viewer (opaque static asset, demos/section-viewer-demo.html).\n               Inline preview is non-interactive; click opens the full viewer in a new tab. -->\n          <a href=\"/v5/demos/section-viewer-demo.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Open the interactive section viewer\" style=\"display:block;position:relative;aspect-ratio:560/270;overflow:hidden;background:#0a0e14\">\n            <!-- Preview renders the demo at 2x width scaled to 50% so its desktop layout fits;\n                 scrolling=\"no\" removes the internal scrollbar (dead anyway under pointer-events:none). -->\n            <iframe data-defer-src=\"/v5/demos/section-viewer-demo.html\" title=\"Interactive cross-section viewer - demonstration data\" scrolling=\"no\"\n                    style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:200%;aspect-ratio:560/270;border:0;display:block;pointer-events:none;background:#0a0e14;transform:scale(.5);transform-origin:0 0\"></iframe>\n          </a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"output-body\">\n          <h3>Sections, envelopes &amp; long-sections</h3>\n          <p>Cross-sections and long-sections that show why each target ranks where it does - alteration zonation, structure and grade in one defensible picture.</p>\n          <span class=\"output-tag\">Porphyry Cu-Au system \u00b7 principal envelope recovered by ensemble scoring</span>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- primary zero-friction CTA -->\n    <div class=\"fly-cta reveal\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-line\" href=\"/v5/viewer.html\">Fly the 3D Deposit Demo <span class=\"arr\">\u2192</span></a>\n      <p class=\"micro\">Instant interactive 3D viewer \u00b7 no login \u00b7 runs in your browser, even offline</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"validated-line\">Blind tests prove recovery of what is already known; live programs are scored before anyone knows - across nickel, copper-gold, iron ore, polymetallic and more. <a class=\"textlink\" href=\"/case-studies\">See the documented case studies &rarr;</a></p>\n    <p class=\"table-disclaimer\">Sanitized for confidentiality - nothing here is a disclosure of exploration results or mineral resources under NI&nbsp;43-101 or the JORC Code, and no economic potential is implied.</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============ 4.7 \u00b7 USE-CASE TEASER ============ -->\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"use-cases-teaser\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">Use cases</p>\n      <h2>One engine, every stage of the hunt.</h2>\n      <p class=\"lead\">From grassroots ground to a producing mine, CAGE-IN solves a different problem at each stage of exploration - reconnaissance, targeting, optimisation, and resource expansion.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cap-chips\" style=\"justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap\">\n      <span class=\"cap-chip\">Reconnaissance</span><span class=\"cap-chip\">Targeting</span><span class=\"cap-chip\">Optimisation</span><span class=\"cap-chip\">Resource expansion</span>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:1.6rem\"><a class=\"textlink\" href=\"/technology#use-cases\">See how CAGE-IN plugs in at each stage &rarr;</a></p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============ 5 \u00b7 THREE DOORS ============ -->\n<section class=\"section section-dark\" id=\"doors\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">Choose your door</p>\n      <h2>Three ways in.</h2>\n      <p class=\"lead\">Miners, national programs and investors come to AiRE with different questions. Each gets its own door - and its own straight answer.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"doors-grid\">\n      <article class=\"door reveal\">\n        <p class=\"d-route\">/explorer</p>\n        <h3>Miners &amp; juniors</h3>\n        <p>Where to drill next - and what it costs. Shorten the discovery cycle and turn the data you already paid for into your next drill program.</p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>48-hour Prospect Brief entry point</li>\n          <li>Full-tenement AI targeting in weeks</li>\n          <li>Board-ready 3D models &amp; maps</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-inv\" href=\"/explorer\">Enter as a miner <span class=\"arr\">\u2192</span></a>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"door reveal\">\n        <p class=\"d-route\">/government</p>\n        <h3>Governments, sovereign wealth &amp; development banks</h3>\n        <p>De-risk exploration at national scale - regional prospectivity mapping that draws investment into your critical and strategic minerals, with full data sovereignty.</p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Regional prospectivity at national scale</li>\n          <li>Skills transfer to your geologists</li>\n          <li>Your data never leaves your control</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-inv\" href=\"/government\">Enter as a program <span class=\"arr\">\u2192</span></a>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"door reveal\">\n        <p class=\"d-route\">/investor</p>\n        <h3>Investors &amp; financial institutions</h3>\n        <p>Rank the assets in your portfolio on technical merit - which holdings are genuinely prospective, where the risk sits, and which would gain most from a CAGE-IN run.</p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Independent portfolio prospectivity review</li>\n          <li>Asset ranking &amp; technical risk analysis</li>\n          <li>White-label / QP licensing available</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-inv\" href=\"/investor\">Enter as an investor <span class=\"arr\">\u2192</span></a>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============ 6 \u00b7 GEOLOGIST TO GEOLOGIST ============ -->\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"direct-line\">\n  <div class=\"wrap-narrow\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Geologist to geologist</p>\n    <h2>Have messy historical data? Let&rsquo;s look at it together.</h2>\n    <p class=\"lead\">Junior budgets are tight and drilling windows close fast. If you want to know whether your legacy geophysics, geochemistry or drill archives can support an AiRE run, skip the contact form and write to the founder directly.</p>\n    <div class=\"contact-card reveal\">\n      <div>\n        <strong>Dr. Amit Tripathi</strong>\n        <p class=\"cc-cred\">PhD, Structural Geology \u00b7 30 years in the field</p>\n        <p class=\"cc-note\">NDA first. Data rooms, not email attachments. Replies come from Amit, not a sales queue - answered personally within two business days.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cc-action\">\n        <a href=\"mailto:info@geoexplorationllc.com?subject=Prospect%20Brief%20request%20-%20legacy%20data%20review\" class=\"btn btn-gold\">Email Amit directly <span class=\"arr\">\u2192</span></a>\n        <span class=\"cc-mail\">info@geoexplorationllc.com</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"spine-band\"><div class=\"wrap\"><p class=\"spine\">We don&rsquo;t add to your data pile - we <span class=\"hl\">resolve it into a ranked drill decision you can sign and defend.</span></p></div></div>\n\n</main>\n\n<!-- ============ FOOTER ============ -->\n";
---
<V5Layout title={title} description={description}>
<Fragment set:html={bodyHtml} />
</V5Layout>
